Subject: [PATCH 09/14] r36 WIP: coin toss / dice roll cutscene (Kevy 29 Oct
 14:29)

- coin-tap.mjs: worker capture of the engine's TOSS_COIN / TOSS_DICE (+ the call read from the duel's own accepted
  response to the 60 Heads / 61 Tails prompt), same conditions as ShuffleTap; worker.mjs sends coin:coinTap.drain().
- coin-cutscene.mjs/.css: CoinScene (original coin + dice art, 3D toss/roll landing on the engine's result, RIGHT/WRONG
  CALL, synthesized sound), coinBatches places each toss right after the event it followed; COIN_MS per preset.
- presentation.mjs: coin batches in the queue (Skip works), clear/reset; app.mjs: dedupe per epoch, heads/tails call
  buttons for the human's call.
- tests/r36-coin.test.mjs: real-engine capture (right / wrong call, both call sides), no effect on the duel (with vs
  without the tap), dice results match Graceful & Skull Dice's ATK change, ordering. SELF-VERIFIED.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
